  "description": "\"What's the use of a pepper grower who has no pepper?\"\n\nReturning to Songhwa Village like a fugitive after quitting her job, Sowon doesn't even get to see the house remodeling finished before getting into a car accident the moment she arrives! Overwhelmed by a string of misfortunes, she ends up drinking heavily with the grandmothers at the village hall.\n\nWhen she wakes up in a daze and wanders into the bathroom, she runs into Woo Kang-jun, a man rumored in the village to be impotent, and his peppe—no, Pringles?\n\n\"Curious? Whether the rumor that I'm impotent is true.\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/297091821)",
